{
 "header": [
  "The page's plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, its regular play of 2-3 minutes: the launcher, Load ROM",
  "on a new profile once the shader list Chrome builds behind the launcher is done (Firefox builds none there, and its",
  "line saying so is the one waited for), Start Game, then Start (Enter) through the splashes to the title, whose",
  "attract race plays behind it, and to the main menu, and A (Space) through Season's menus as a player does (Novice,",
  "the first rider) to its first race, Kyoto, past the track's intro to the countdown. There the rider rides with the",
  "throttle (A) held, steering a little each way, and the pause menu is opened with Start and closed again: a minute",
  "and a half of the race, on the race's own clock (gRaceFrame, 60 a second, which stands still while the game is",
  "paused, so the plan lets go of it there). Where the game is comes from",
  "tools/shader_survey.js (state(), screen(), racing())."
